# The Best of Both Worlds ({4}{W}{U} Saga) on turn 3, after Bot2 has cast two Kobolds of Kher Keep (no mana needed): chapter
# I assimilates only the chosen one (Bot1 controls it as a 1/2 artifact creature Borg with a +1/+1 counter, no longer a
# Kobold), refuses Bot1's own Kobolds and Ornithopter, and the Saga remembers it. Bot1's Ornithopter, an artifact creature,
# is a control for chapter II on turn 5: it gets +2/+2 until end of turn while Bot1's nonartifact Kobolds and Bot2's
# creatures do not, and the pump is gone on turn 6. Chapter III on turn 7 exiles the remembered Borg and returns it under
# Bot2's control as a new object with its printed characteristics, then the Saga sacrifices itself after III (CR 714.4,
# 607.2d, 400.7, 611.2c).

